# T12 - flags and dsize on a TCP session to port 9003 (both directions: "<>")
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 flags S exactly"; flags:S; sid:12001;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 flags SA exactly"; flags:SA; sid:12002;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 flags A exactly"; flags:A; sid:12003;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 ACK set, others free"; flags:A+; sid:12004;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 SYN or FIN set"; flags:SF*; sid:12005;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 PSH+ACK with 10 bytes"; flags:PA; dsize:10; sid:12006;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 empty payload"; dsize:0; sid:12007;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 payload under 5 bytes"; dsize:<5; sid:12008;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 payload of exactly 10 bytes"; dsize:10; sid:12009;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 any payload"; dsize:>0; sid:12010;)
alert tcp any any <> any 9003 (msg:"T12 payload from 5 to 15 bytes"; dsize:5<>15; sid:12011;)
